@app = http://localhost:8080
@mgmt = http://localhost:8081

### the application (port 8080)
GET {{app}}/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json

### liveness - no checks, 200 as long as Kestrel answers
GET {{mgmt}}/healthz/live

### readiness - ApplicationLifecycle + ResourceUtilization; 503 while shutting down
GET {{mgmt}}/healthz/ready

### startup - 503 for the first ~10s (WarmupService, Warmup:DelaySeconds), then 200
GET {{mgmt}}/healthz/startup

### Prometheus scrape endpoint
GET {{mgmt}}/metrics

### build / pod identity
GET {{mgmt}}/info

### management endpoints are NOT reachable on the app port -> 404
GET {{app}}/healthz/live
